    PEMDAS: parenthesis, exponents, multiplication, division. addition, subtraction
        a conventio to get the same answer to a calc


    we do calculationby following the PEMDAS:
        1st we evaluate any parenthetical terms
        then we apply exponents
        then we perform multiplication/division   {we do operation to left 1st (as we go from left to right) }
        then we perform addition/subtraction  {we do operation to left 1st (as we go from left to right) }


